tps://api.github.com/users/Trae-AI-Admin","html_url":"https://github.com/Trae-AI-Admin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Trae-AI-Admin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Trae-AI-Admin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Trae-AI-Admin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Trae-AI-Admin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Trae-AI-Admin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Trae-AI-Admin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Trae-AI-Admin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Trae-AI-Admin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Trae-AI-Admin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-25T06:52:46Z","updated_at":"2025-04-25T06:52:46Z","body":"您好，如果依然存在这个问题，请在IDE内反馈","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/comments/2829528643/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/comments/3141036218","html_url":"https://github.com/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/843#issuecomment-3141036218","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/843","id":3141036218,"node_id":"IC_kwDONiYvnc67OGi6","user":{"login":"HuxyDane","id":127152624,"node_id":"U_kgDOB5Qx8A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/127152624?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HuxyDane","html_url":"https://github.com/HuxyDane","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HuxyDane/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HuxyDane/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HuxyDane/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HuxyDane/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HuxyDane/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HuxyDane/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HuxyDane/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HuxyDane/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HuxyDane/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-31T18:59:32Z","updated_at":"2025-07-31T19:00:23Z","body":"@sk1F25 \nWhen you try to use a shortcut on a different keyboard layout (like Russian), the key binding doesn’t match anymore — for example, Ctrl+A becomes Ctrl+Ф, which Trae doesn’t recognize. and VScode intercepts it and uses it in a different way than you expect\n\nSo if you want to fix it, you have to rewrite shortcut this way:\n\n```>Preferences: Open Keyboard Shortcuts (JSON)```\n\n```\n[\n  {\n    \"key\": \"ctrl+a\",\n    \"command\": \"editor.action.selectAll\",\n    \"when\": \"textInputFocus\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"key\": \"ctrl+a\",\n    \"command\": \"-editor.action.selectAll\"\n  }\n]\n```\n\nThere may be a more elegant way of how to solve this, but for myself I'm using this for now. If you find it, please let me know\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/comments/3141036218/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":2,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/comments/3193845538","html_url":"https://github.com/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/843#issuecomment-3193845538","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/843","id":3193845538,"node_id":"IC_kwDONiYvnc6-Xjci","user":{"login":"ak40u","id":696468,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY5NjQ2OA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/696468?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ak40u","html_url":"https://github.com/ak40u","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ak40u/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ak40u/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ak40u/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ak40u/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ak40u/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ak40u/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ak40u/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ak40u/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ak40u/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-16T18:52:23Z","updated_at":"2025-08-16T18:52:45Z","body":"> [@sk1F25](https://github.com/sk1F25) When you try to use a shortcut on a different keyboard layout (like Russian), the key binding doesn’t match anymore — for example, Ctrl+A becomes Ctrl+Ф, which Trae doesn’t recognize. and VScode intercepts it and uses it in a different way than you expect\n> \n> So if you want to fix it, you have to rewrite shortcut this way:\n> \n> `>Preferences: Open Keyboard Shortcuts (JSON)`\n> \n> ```\n> [\n>   {\n>     \"key\": \"ctrl+a\",\n>     \"command\": \"editor.action.selectAll\",\n>     \"when\": \"textInputFocus\"\n>   },\n>   {\n>     \"key\": \"ctrl+a\",\n>     \"command\": \"-editor.action.selectAll\"\n>   }\n> ]\n> ```\n> \n> There may be a more elegant way of how to solve this, but for myself I'm using this for now. If you find it, please let me know\n\nIt helps me! \n\nI have two layouts: English and Russian.\n\nJust paste this bindings to the json file:\n\n```[\n  {\n    \"key\": \"ctrl+a\",\n    \"command\": \"editor.action.selectAll\",\n    \"when\": \"textInputFocus\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"key\": \"ctrl+a\",\n    \"command\": \"-editor.action.selectAll\"\n},\n{\n    \"key\": \"ctrl+z\",\n    \"command\": \"undo\",\n    \"when\": \"textInputFocus\"\n}, \n{\n    \"key\": \"ctrl+z\",\n    \"command\": \"-undo\",\n    \"when\": \"\"\n}\n]\n```","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/comments/3193845538/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/comments/3957862241","html_url":"https://github.com/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/843#issuecomment-3957862241","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/843","id":3957862241,"node_id":"IC_kwDONiYvnc7r6C9h","user":{"login":"Gh0sTG0","id":13123855,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzMTIzODU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13123855?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gh0sTG0","html_url":"https://github.com/Gh0sTG0","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gh0sTG0/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gh0sTG0/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gh0sTG0/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gh0sTG0/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gh0sTG0/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gh0sTG0/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gh0sTG0/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gh0sTG0/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gh0sTG0/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-25T09:14:58Z","updated_at":"2026-02-25T09:17:30Z","body":"Dear TRAE team. Pls fix this shit. It hurts.\nPS and now that json file is readonly, so I can't edit it and set new keys...","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/comments/3957862241/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]}